CodeSystem: CPGConformanceCategoryCS
Id: cpg-conformance-category-cs
Title: "CPG Conformance Category Code System"
Description: "Categories used to group the conformance statements of this implementation guide."
* insert CodeSystemMetadata(cpg-conformance-category)
* #artifact "Knowledge Artifact" "Requirements on the structure and profiles of knowledge artifacts, such as plan definitions, activity definitions, and case feature definitions."
* #recommendation "Recommendation" "Requirements on how recommendations, strategies, and pathways, and their supporting information, are represented."
* #activity "Activity" "Requirements on how proposed and performed activities are represented."
* #data "Data" "Requirements on the case features and interoperability profiles used by guideline content."
* #terminology "Terminology" "Requirements on code systems and value sets defined by guideline content."
* #logic "Logic" "Requirements on libraries of computable logic, such as CQL libraries."
* #documentation "Documentation" "Requirements on the documentation that content implementation guides provide."
* #behavior "System Behavior" "Requirements on the behavior of systems that implement this guide, such as CPG Services, CPG Clients, and CPG Knowledge Repositories."
